{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06992","headline":"闻漏 · 王岳灵","name":"闻漏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"建礼含香处，重城待漏臣。\n徐闻传凤诏，晓唱辨鸡人。\n银箭残将尽，铜壶漏更新。\n催筹当午夜，移刻及三辰。\n杳杳从天远，泠泠出禁频。\n直疑残漏曙，肃肃对钩陈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王岳灵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06992.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06992","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}